sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Relawan
    participant W as Web
    participant A as API FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    P->>W: buka Citra › Sentinel-1
    W->>A: GET /api/citra/areas/1/scenes?source=s1 (cookie)
    A->>A: decode JWT → user_id
    A->>DB: auth_session_user(user_id)
    DB-->>A: role USER, aktif
    A->>A: require_role("PUBLIC") ✓
    A->>DB: BEGIN#59; SET LOCAL ROLE monitor_user#59; set_config('app.user_id', id)
    A->>DB: SELECT … FROM v_citra_scenes
    Note over A,DB: VIEW membatasi 365 hari untuk monitor_user
    DB-->>A: daftar tanggal
    A->>DB: COMMIT (role kembali otomatis)
    A-->>W: 200 JSON
    W-->>P: daftar tanggal dan gambar